results/*
!results/README.md
!results/ledger/
!results/ledger/**
!results/habitat2020/
!results/habitat2020/README.md
!results/habitat2020/*.json

# ---- CARD GATE-0b (scrum/20260822/task_30): the results carve-out ----------
# THE DEFECT. `results/*` above ignores everything and then negates four
# subtrees, so 55 sibling files under this directory are tracked while
# `results/barn_ros2/` and `results/threewe/` are not -- and six tests read
# those files by name. On this dev box they are on disk and green; in every
# fresh clone they are absent and the tests die with FileNotFoundError. That is
# structurally the same defect card GATE-0 fixed for the Unitree MJCF pack one
# directory over (root .gitignore:63-91).
#
# THE MANIFEST -- what these four lines add, exactly, and why nothing else:
#   results/barn_ros2/   5 files, 28 KB -- the upstream MPPI world-0 baseline
#                        (`upstream-mppi-world0-20260803.json` + `.raw.txt`),
#                        the paired Parcel row, and their README. This is
#                        EVIDENCE a re-run cannot reproduce (it records another
#                        stack's numbers), which is why it belongs in git.
#   results/threewe/     2 files, 24 KB -- the ThreeWE contract-audit baseline
#                        and its README.
# Everything else under `results/` stays ignored ON PURPOSE and the negations
# below are written subtree-by-subtree so it cannot change by accident:
#   results/runs/              38 files, 3.1 MB of regenerable A/B run dumps
#   results/latest_report.json a rewritten "latest" pointer, not a record
# Total added: 7 files, 52 KB. Nothing here is generated by a test; nothing
# here is large; and `evals/external/results/README.md` documents the rest.
!results/barn_ros2/
!results/barn_ros2/**
!results/threewe/
!results/threewe/**
# ---- END CARD GATE-0b ------------------------------------------------------

# Bulky local training / development evidence (keep sources + ledgers tracked)
training/**/results/runs/
development/**/results/single-use-development-action-evidence/
development/**/results/single-use-development-transaction/
*.v8e
*.v8ae
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
